1
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:33,800
The trio have violated
celestial laws by...

2
00:01:33,800 --> 00:01:36,200
granting mortals' wishes
indiscriminately

3
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:41,400
They shall be stripped of their
powers and titles to become mortals

4
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:47,200
I'll have you know suffering precedes
any elevation to celestial status

5
00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:53,000
As of today, you shall undergo
much suffering in the mortal world -

6
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:57,400
birth, old age, illness, death, love,
parting, enmity and separation

7
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:59,400
Only then will you stop...

8
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:03,200
bestowing fortune, longevity and
riches indiscriminately

9
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:08,400
The punishment may bring
suffering upon the mortals

10
00:02:09,200 --> 00:02:13,200
The mortal world may be beset
with calamities and misery...

11
00:02:13,200 --> 00:02:15,000
without the trio

12
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:18,800
Your Majesty, how about them
redeeming themselves through...

13
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:21,400
helping the mortal world
ride out the calamities?

14
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:26,200
Listen good. Before you turn
30 years of age in the mortal world,

15
00:02:26,200 --> 00:02:28,200
you are to accomplish three things

16
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:31,400
Firstly, do good deeds along the way

17
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:33,800
Accumulate enough merit

18
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:36,400
Secondly, reform God of Plague

19
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:40,600
Thirdly, spread fortune and longevity

20
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:45,800
Then will you be reinstated and granted
a return to the Celestial Court

21
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:57,600
Just as well we've been relegated

22
00:02:57,600 --> 00:03:02,000
No more dealings with God of Wealth
and God of Kitchen

23
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:03,800
Our ears won't suffer anymore

24
00:03:04,200 --> 00:03:08,800
The mortals have this saying:
Better a beggar than a court official

25
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:12,600
No one covets the office. That tells
us what a carefree life they lead

26
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:16,800
The mortals have another saying

27
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:20,400
One would rather be a pair of
Mandarin ducks than a deity

28
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:24,600
The mortal world enjoys four seasons
- spring, summer, autumn and winter

29
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:27,600
A leisurely life awaits us

30
00:03:27,600 --> 00:03:32,800
It's so boring and monotonous here.
Let's make our way down sooner

31
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:37,200
Ma-gu, are you here to see us off?

32
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:39,400
Looks like you're taking it easy

33
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:44,000
We'll cross the bridge
when we come to it

34
00:03:45,200 --> 00:03:48,200
Jade Emperor hasn't sent you
to the mortal world to enjoy life

35
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:50,800
You'll be dumbfounded
if you learn the truth

36
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:52,400
What is it?

37
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:55,200
You probably have no idea
what's in store for you

38
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:57,800
What does His Majesty want?

39
00:03:58,200 --> 00:04:03,800
We're not afraid. A mortal's life
is but a challenge

40
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:06,400
We're all raring to give it a go

41
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:10,680
You know not what you're getting
into. See for yourselves!

42
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:18,400
I'm telling you the truth
because I feel sorry for you,

43
00:04:18,400 --> 00:04:20,800
lest you get helpless
when the time comes

44
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:22,600
It's better to know what to expect

45
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:25,800
You've bestowed blessings on
mortals indiscriminately

46
00:04:25,800 --> 00:04:28,800
The Jade Emperor therefore wants you
to be one denied of blessings

47
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:32,000
Abandoned by your parents since
young, you'll lead a life of strife

48
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:35,400
You're destined to lose any happiness
you may find in life

49
00:04:35,400 --> 00:04:40,400
Even if you find your dream girl,
your love won't run smoothly

50
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:43,400
You'll be deprived of love,
girls and good food

51
00:04:45,400 --> 00:04:48,400
-I'm going faint
-Easy!

52
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:53,400
What about me, Ma-gu? Things
can't be worse for me, I think?

53
00:04:53,400 --> 00:04:55,400
See for yourself

54
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:02,200
You're a wine-lover
who faints from too much drink

55
00:05:02,200 --> 00:05:05,800
So the Jade Emperor will give you
a sickly body

56
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:09,200
You'll be saddled with illnesses
which won't kill you but...

57
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:11,400
leave you half-dead

58
00:05:11,400 --> 00:05:13,400
You'll suffer more than
anyone else on earth

59
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:17,000
Ma-gu, don't tell me
that fat man is me?

60
00:05:18,200 --> 00:05:20,200
Take a seat

61
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:25,400
Trust the Jade Emperor to come up
with such a punishment

62
00:05:25,400 --> 00:05:28,800
-You won't be any better-off
-What about me?

63
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:33,000
Your path to office will be fraught
with difficulties and setbacks

64
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:35,000
You'll also lead
a life of disappointments

65
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:36,200
Really?

66
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:42,200
Let me out!

67
00:05:43,200 --> 00:05:44,600
It's as hard as a stone

68
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:07,200
Lu, are you all right?
Come, get up

69
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:09,600
Are you all right?

70
00:06:10,400 --> 00:06:12,200
I'm not done yet

71
00:06:12,200 --> 00:06:16,400
Don't expect to enjoy any adulation
in the mortal world

72
00:06:16,400 --> 00:06:20,400
In fact, the three of you
will be scorned and despised

73
00:06:20,400 --> 00:06:23,400
You'll be deemed the three vermins

74
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:25,400
The three vermins?

75
00:06:26,400 --> 00:06:28,000
Say no more

76
00:06:28,200 --> 00:06:30,200
We don't wish to be mortals anymore

77
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:32,800
Your time has come

78
00:06:36,400 --> 00:06:39,400
I did think of letting
the three of you off

79
00:06:39,400 --> 00:06:43,000
But the Jade Emperor will
certainly hold me accountable

80
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:46,200
I don't mind getting punished,
but the three of you are my friends

81
00:06:46,200 --> 00:06:49,200
So how can I bear to see you feel bad
that I get punished?

82
00:06:49,200 --> 00:06:52,400
After much deliberation,
I've decided not to let you off

83
00:06:52,400 --> 00:06:56,400
Old Zhang, never mind
if you're unable to help us,

84
00:06:56,400 --> 00:06:58,600
but spare us those jibes

85
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:03,920
-My dear friend
-My dear friend...

86
00:07:04,400 --> 00:07:07,400
If Fate so decrees it,
we shall meet again

87
00:07:08,200 --> 00:07:11,400
Don't hold me back.
Let me go first

88
00:07:11,400 --> 00:07:12,400
No...

89
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:19,920
Zhang Guolao, I'm ready

90
00:07:23,200 --> 00:07:24,800
Don't look.
Off you go!

91
00:07:27,480 --> 00:07:28,480
Take care!

92
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:32,920
With us gone,
you'll have no more company

93
00:07:34,400 --> 00:07:35,600
Farewell

94
00:07:37,400 --> 00:07:38,800
Lu...

95
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:41,680
Farewell

96
00:07:42,400 --> 00:07:44,400
I'll miss you

97
00:07:44,400 --> 00:07:45,800
Goodbye!

98
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:49,800
Goodbye

99
00:07:50,600 --> 00:07:53,200
I'll make the jump myself

100
00:07:54,400 --> 00:07:56,400
-That direction
-All right

101
00:07:58,400 --> 00:07:59,400
Take care

102
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:00,800
What a nag!

103
00:08:04,400 --> 00:08:06,800
Make the jump yourself?
Fat chance! Next!

104
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:12,400
Have you anything to say to me?

105
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:17,200
Seriously, I do want
to say something to you

106
00:08:19,200 --> 00:08:22,800
I used to tease and bully you
in the past,

107
00:08:23,200 --> 00:08:25,200
causing you much embarrassment

108
00:08:25,200 --> 00:08:28,400
I hope you won't be angry with me.
Don't be upset either

109
00:08:29,200 --> 00:08:30,400
I'm sorry

110
00:08:30,400 --> 00:08:33,800
Is this some joke?
You never say sorry

111
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:38,800
I'm sincere about apologizing to you
this time round

112
00:08:38,800 --> 00:08:43,000
If I don't say it now, I may never
get the chance to do so again

113
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:46,000
I'm sorry

114
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:51,400
I'll be going.
Take care

115
00:09:02,800 --> 00:09:05,800
Old Zhang, it's so high up

116
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:09,400
I'm afraid of heights.
Do not push me

117
00:09:09,400 --> 00:09:11,200
I'll make my own way down

118
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:12,400
Don't worry

119
00:09:12,400 --> 00:09:15,400
Though you gave me a slap just now,
I won't bear grudges against you

120
00:09:15,400 --> 00:09:17,000
Make your own way down

121
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:20,000
By the way, don't bully Ma-gu

122
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:23,400
-Take care of her
-I will. Be on your way

123
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:31,000
You lied to me!

124
00:09:31,200 --> 00:09:32,480
Bingo!

125
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:39,200
From this moment on,

126
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:42,400
they've been relegated to mortals
who will suffer much

127
00:09:42,400 --> 00:09:44,400
They'll need all the blessings
in the world

128
00:09:47,400 --> 00:09:50,600
What's wrong?
You'll have peace now

129
00:09:54,400 --> 00:09:56,400
Dear, don't do this!

130
00:09:58,200 --> 00:09:59,800
Don't do this, dear!

131
00:10:00,800 --> 00:10:02,200
I'll have it out with you!

132
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:06,400
-Murder carries a death penalty
-Adultery is an offence too!

133
00:10:06,400 --> 00:10:09,200
I'll kill you two
before turning myself in

134
00:10:09,400 --> 00:10:13,400
My unborn child and I shall
pay you life for life!

135
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:18,000
Your life isn't worth much!
Take a good look in the mirror

136
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:22,800
You have the look of an unlucky woman.
Woe is the man who marries you!

137
00:10:22,800 --> 00:10:24,400
No wonder your husband
doesn't want you!

138
00:10:24,400 --> 00:10:26,400
I don't wish to live anymore...!

139
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:32,800
Don't get so worked up, Mrs Wu.
Take a seat

140
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:37,000
-I don't wish to live anymore
-Hear me out

141
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:40,800
There you are, midwife.
I've been looking for you

142
00:10:41,400 --> 00:10:45,000
Take care. Do take care of
your unborn child

143
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:49,800
My daughter-in-law is going into
labour. I'd like you to help her

144
00:10:49,800 --> 00:10:54,400
I'm sorry, Old Master Wei.
Today has been my lucky day

145
00:10:54,400 --> 00:10:57,600
The Wu and Mei families have
already engaged my services

146
00:10:57,600 --> 00:10:59,800
It's a double joy!

147
00:11:00,400 --> 00:11:06,200
Good! If you say yes to me,
it'll be triple happiness!

148
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:09,200
All good things come in threes

149
00:11:09,200 --> 00:11:11,800
Come, go and attend to
my daughter-in-law now

150
00:11:11,800 --> 00:11:13,800
I'm afraid I won't be able to cope

151
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:16,800
Mrs Wu, where are you off to?

152
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:20,000
Let me be.
Just leave me to die

153
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:23,800
-Life has lost its meaning for me
-Don't entertain those thoughts

154
00:11:23,800 --> 00:11:27,400
Come with me.
Old Master Mei is expecting us

155
00:11:27,400 --> 00:11:30,000
Let's get going

156
00:11:30,200 --> 00:11:33,200
Let me give you a ride
in my horse carriage

157
00:11:33,400 --> 00:11:37,600
-Mrs Wei's belly is huge
-Get on the carriage

158
00:11:40,400 --> 00:11:42,800
Go faster

159
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:46,200
-Are we reaching yet?
-Soon, soon

160
00:11:46,400 --> 00:11:49,200
Their bellies are
as big as watermelons

161
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:51,400
I'm sure they'll have bouncing babies

162
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:56,200
Are you going into labour?

163
00:11:56,600 --> 00:11:59,400
-I think she is!
-Hang in there

164
00:11:59,400 --> 00:12:02,400
Brother Wei, get the groom
to move the carriage faster

165
00:12:02,400 --> 00:12:05,600
We must not let the child
be born on a journey

166
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:10,000
We don't want him
to catch the chill on the road

167
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:11,800
Master Ma, step on it!

168
00:12:15,480 --> 00:12:19,400
There is no escape for
the three of you!

169
00:12:19,400 --> 00:12:21,800
Neither immortality nor mortality
for you!

170
00:12:57,200 --> 00:12:59,600
Let me send you to your doom!

171
00:13:01,400 --> 00:13:03,200
Turn!

172
00:13:06,400 --> 00:13:07,400
Halt!

173
00:13:17,800 --> 00:13:19,800
That's the way to go

174
00:13:38,400 --> 00:13:39,400
Brother Wei

175
00:14:40,400 --> 00:14:41,600
My dear!

176
00:14:42,400 --> 00:14:45,400
I see the Three Star Temple!
Let's take refuge there

177
00:14:45,600 --> 00:14:47,800
Let us go there too

178
00:14:49,800 --> 00:14:53,000
My dear, you must hang in there

179
00:14:55,480 --> 00:14:57,200
Push harder

180
00:15:00,800 --> 00:15:02,600
Push harder.
You'll be fine

181
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:42,200
I thought you were the door god

182
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:46,000
It turns out to be you, Ma-gu.
What are you doing here?

183
00:15:46,200 --> 00:15:49,920
God of Plague, show mercy.
Spare the three young lives

184
00:15:50,200 --> 00:15:52,400
The trio captured my Nian

185
00:15:52,400 --> 00:15:55,800
Until I kill them,
I won't let the matter rest

186
00:15:55,800 --> 00:15:59,000
The beast was a menace. It was only
right that they subdued it

187
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:03,400
Only right? Perhaps you think it fair

188
00:16:03,400 --> 00:16:07,400
But when has Heaven ever
shown fairness to me?

189
00:16:07,400 --> 00:16:09,400
At Queen Mother's birthday banquet,

190
00:16:09,400 --> 00:16:13,200
gods and deities from
the three realms were present

191
00:16:13,200 --> 00:16:15,000
Only I wasn't invited!

192
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:20,800
You've got to ask yourself what good
you've done to the people

193
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:23,600
Cut the crap!
Are you moving aside or not?

194
00:16:23,600 --> 00:16:25,800
If I let you have your wicked way,

195
00:16:25,800 --> 00:16:28,400
I'll be too ashamed
to be called a deity!

196
00:16:28,600 --> 00:16:30,400
Then I shall turn nasty!

197
00:16:30,400 --> 00:16:32,400
Be my guest!
You don't scare me

198
00:17:05,400 --> 00:17:06,800
Push harder

199
00:17:07,200 --> 00:17:08,800
You'll be fine

200
00:17:09,800 --> 00:17:11,800
Push harder.
The baby is coming out

201
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:13,800
Everything will be fine

202
00:17:17,200 --> 00:17:18,800
Madam!

203
00:17:28,400 --> 00:17:31,800
Wake up, midwife!

204
00:17:32,400 --> 00:17:35,400
The baby is coming out!
You've got to help them

205
00:17:37,200 --> 00:17:38,200
Hey!

206
00:17:42,800 --> 00:17:47,400
Shishi, Feifei, show yourselves.
The three stars will be born soon

207
00:17:48,800 --> 00:17:51,400
-What's up?
-You wanted to see us?

208
00:17:51,400 --> 00:17:53,400
See for yourselves!

209
00:17:53,400 --> 00:17:55,400
Help deliver the babies

210
00:17:55,400 --> 00:17:57,400
We don't know how to do it

211
00:17:57,400 --> 00:18:02,200
Don't get us involved. Just being
present makes us go numb in the head

212
00:18:02,200 --> 00:18:04,800
You'll handle it yourself

213
00:18:04,920 --> 00:18:06,400
So long!

214
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:30,400
It's God of Plague

215
00:19:06,400 --> 00:19:08,400
I've got to give it my all now

216
00:19:08,600 --> 00:19:11,400
I must have owed you three
in my past life

217
00:19:11,400 --> 00:19:15,000
You used to bully me and now,
I have to be your midwife

218
00:19:20,600 --> 00:19:23,000
Push harder

219
00:19:25,200 --> 00:19:26,400
I'm here

220
00:19:31,200 --> 00:19:32,400
Coming

221
00:19:34,600 --> 00:19:37,800
Don't worry.
I'm here. Push harder

222
00:19:39,800 --> 00:19:41,400
Harder!

223
00:20:03,600 --> 00:20:05,400
Push harder!

224
00:20:08,000 --> 00:20:09,200
Mission accomplished

225
00:20:29,600 --> 00:20:33,400
Don't rejoice just yet, trio

226
00:20:34,400 --> 00:20:36,400
I'll kill you one day!

227
00:20:48,200 --> 00:20:51,400
You're still as naughty as ever

228
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:55,920
Let me spank your bottom
to teach you a lesson

229
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:09,600
Longevity Star, you're too much

230
00:21:19,000 --> 00:21:20,200
Let me wrap you up

231
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:39,400
Who delivered the babies?
What's going on?

232
00:21:42,520 --> 00:21:45,400
Did the three stars have
a part in it?

233
00:21:49,200 --> 00:21:50,800
My dear

234
00:21:53,200 --> 00:21:54,800
Is he our son?

235
00:21:59,800 --> 00:22:02,800
Thank you so much, madam

236
00:22:02,800 --> 00:22:04,800
We can never repay your kindness

237
00:22:04,800 --> 00:22:07,200
I was only doing my job

238
00:22:07,600 --> 00:22:10,400
Congratulations on
having a son, madams

239
00:22:10,400 --> 00:22:13,200
Congratulations, Old Master Wei
and Old Master Mei

240
00:22:13,400 --> 00:22:16,200
Thank you, San-niang

241
00:22:16,400 --> 00:22:17,800
-Thank you!
-Thank you, madam

242
00:22:17,800 --> 00:22:24,400
You're most welcome. By the way,
have you named the boys?

243
00:22:27,200 --> 00:22:29,200
I'm not in any mood to name my son

244
00:22:29,400 --> 00:22:32,200
Your child is not as fortunate

245
00:22:32,400 --> 00:22:36,400
While other children are born with
their fathers around, he...

246
00:22:36,800 --> 00:22:38,400
Poor child

247
00:22:39,200 --> 00:22:42,200
San-niang, I'll name my son Fuqi

248
00:22:43,200 --> 00:22:45,200
-May he enjoy good fortune (fu qi)
-That's a good name

249
00:22:45,200 --> 00:22:48,800
-Nice name!
-That's a good name!

250
00:22:49,800 --> 00:22:53,200
I come from a family of learned men.
But we've yet to produce a top scholar

251
00:22:53,200 --> 00:22:55,800
I hope my son will be
an official one day

252
00:22:55,800 --> 00:22:59,200
Let's call him... Delu!

253
00:22:59,200 --> 00:23:01,400
What do you think, my dear?

254
00:23:01,400 --> 00:23:03,400
Yes, let's call him Delu

255
00:23:03,800 --> 00:23:06,800
We have Fuqi and Delu

256
00:23:07,800 --> 00:23:11,000
I'll call my son Shouquan

257
00:23:13,800 --> 00:23:16,800
The three of them were born in
Three Star Temple and...

258
00:23:16,800 --> 00:23:19,800
their names contain Fu (fortune),
Lu (prosperity) and Shou (longevity)

259
00:23:19,800 --> 00:23:21,400
Isn't it just wonderful?

260
00:23:33,400 --> 00:23:36,400
That's all I can do for you, trio

261
00:23:36,400 --> 00:23:38,400
The rest is in your own hands

262
00:23:54,000 --> 00:23:56,800
Someone told you my wife
had run away from home?

263
00:23:56,800 --> 00:24:00,400
-Is it true?
-You bet. Why would I lie to you?

264
00:24:06,200 --> 00:24:09,000
Oh no.
My wife has really left home

265
00:24:11,200 --> 00:24:14,800
Heaven is on my side.
My perseverance has paid off

266
00:24:14,800 --> 00:24:17,800
I shall be your lawful wife from on!

267
00:24:18,200 --> 00:24:21,400
That's no problem. Thing is,
she's taken my child away

268
00:24:21,800 --> 00:24:26,000
That won't do.
I must get my child back

269
00:24:28,200 --> 00:24:30,400
The old makes way for the new

270
00:24:30,400 --> 00:24:33,400
I'm also a woman. I can always
give you another child

271
00:24:33,400 --> 00:24:36,200
I promise I'll give you
a fair and chubby boy!

272
00:24:36,400 --> 00:24:37,400
I...

273
00:24:55,200 --> 00:24:58,400
It's a boy!
She's given me a boy

274
00:24:59,400 --> 00:25:01,400
I have a son now!

275
00:25:02,600 --> 00:25:04,200
What are you doing?

276
00:25:04,200 --> 00:25:07,400
Aren't you protective!
He looks like a rascal

277
00:25:07,400 --> 00:25:10,880
Don't you scold my son.
He's my darling

278
00:25:16,400 --> 00:25:18,200
It has my son's name

279
00:25:18,400 --> 00:25:21,800
Fuqi... My son is called Fuqi

280
00:25:22,600 --> 00:25:25,200
-Good fortune indeed!
-My dear son

281
00:25:25,200 --> 00:25:29,400
This rascal's arrival means
tough days ahead of me

282
00:25:30,200 --> 00:25:31,400
Don't say that

283
00:25:33,000 --> 00:25:34,400
Let me feel you

284
00:25:38,400 --> 00:25:43,920
He pooed. Carry him while
I get him a fresh change of clothes

285
00:25:51,200 --> 00:25:52,200
Dafeng!

286
00:25:52,480 --> 00:25:54,600
Dafeng, what happened?

287
00:25:57,200 --> 00:25:59,400
Dafeng, are you all right?

288
00:26:01,800 --> 00:26:03,200
I doubt I can make it

289
00:26:03,600 --> 00:26:06,800
Is there anyone?
Help! Help!

290
00:26:09,200 --> 00:26:12,800
Fuqi is a descendant of the Wu family

291
00:26:13,200 --> 00:26:16,000
You must be good to him

292
00:26:16,400 --> 00:26:18,200
I have to look after him?

293
00:26:18,400 --> 00:26:23,800
Treat my son well and you'll have
a windfall every year, I promise

294
00:26:23,800 --> 00:26:27,800
A major one or a minor one?
Tell me, quick!

295
00:26:27,800 --> 00:26:29,200
How many times a year?

296
00:26:29,400 --> 00:26:34,400
If you mistreat my son,
I... I won't let you off!

297
00:26:38,920 --> 00:26:42,000
Why should I provide for the child
you had with your wife?

298
00:26:42,200 --> 00:26:45,800
I have nothing to gain
but everything to lose

299
00:26:45,800 --> 00:26:47,400
Why should I do it?

300
00:27:21,200 --> 00:27:27,200
Wretch, by abandoning the baby
and running away,

301
00:27:27,400 --> 00:27:29,800
retribution will befall you

302
00:27:56,200 --> 00:28:00,800
O heavens, what's life going
to be like with this burden in tow?

303
00:28:02,000 --> 00:28:06,200
How will I ever find a husband?
Just let me die...

304
00:28:08,680 --> 00:28:11,400
Let's begin our lesson

305
00:28:11,400 --> 00:28:15,200
I expect you
to pay attention in class

306
00:28:15,200 --> 00:28:20,400
A man who slackens in his youth
will not be accomplished in life

307
00:28:24,000 --> 00:28:26,200
-What are you boys doing?
-Master, he is toxic

308
00:28:26,400 --> 00:28:29,200
That's rubbish.
He is not toxic

309
00:28:29,400 --> 00:28:33,000
He's sick all the time.
We don't want to be infected

310
00:28:33,400 --> 00:28:36,400
He's known as the God of Ailments.
No one wants to go near him

311
00:28:36,400 --> 00:28:40,400
Since he's the God of Ailments,
that means no poison can overcome him

312
00:28:40,400 --> 00:28:43,800
-That's something!
-In that case, you'll sit beside him

313
00:28:43,800 --> 00:28:47,000
Why should I take orders from you?
Who do you think you are?

314
00:28:47,000 --> 00:28:48,000
Thank you

315
00:28:48,200 --> 00:28:50,200
I'm just standing up for what's right

316
00:28:53,000 --> 00:28:55,800
Stop laughing.
Back to your seats

317
00:28:58,000 --> 00:29:00,800
And you, back to your seat!

318
00:29:04,200 --> 00:29:05,680
Open your book

319
00:29:11,400 --> 00:29:13,000
What are you writing?

320
00:29:13,400 --> 00:29:17,000
Rote learning kills

321
00:29:19,000 --> 00:29:21,400
You're here to learn but
you write nonsense!

322
00:29:21,400 --> 00:29:24,800
Do you plan to be a failure in life?

323
00:29:24,800 --> 00:29:28,800
Master, I do want to learn but
the standard here is way too low

324
00:29:28,800 --> 00:29:31,200
I recited the classics in reverse
order even before I turned four

325
00:29:31,200 --> 00:29:36,800
Nonsense! A liar at a tender age.
You're hopeless!

326
00:29:37,000 --> 00:29:39,400
Master, shall we have a contest?

327
00:29:39,600 --> 00:29:43,800
Let's see which one of us is able
to recite the prose backwards

328
00:29:43,800 --> 00:29:45,000
I'll start

329
00:29:45,200 --> 00:29:49,800
"drive lacks grouser a, spirit in poor
is grouser a, man contented..."

330
00:29:49,800 --> 00:29:53,200
Enough of your nonsense!
You'll stand outside the classroom

331
00:29:54,480 --> 00:29:59,000
You too!
Both of you are two of a kind

332
00:29:59,000 --> 00:30:00,000
Scram!

333
00:30:01,000 --> 00:30:04,800
Master, I'm sorry.
I'm sorry I'm late

334
00:30:07,000 --> 00:30:09,400
Why are you always late for class?

335
00:30:09,400 --> 00:30:12,800
I'm sorry.
Please give me another chance

336
00:30:12,800 --> 00:30:15,200
Get away from that seat!

337
00:30:15,800 --> 00:30:20,200
So what if your father is
an official? You don't scare me!

338
00:30:20,400 --> 00:30:22,800
Are you tired of living?

339
00:30:30,200 --> 00:30:31,400
Stop fighting

340
00:30:31,400 --> 00:30:32,400
Beat him!

341
00:30:33,000 --> 00:30:34,400
Who hit me?

342
00:30:36,000 --> 00:30:37,200
Go away

343
00:30:39,800 --> 00:30:42,400
Out you go!
The three of you are vermins!

344
00:30:42,600 --> 00:30:45,800
No, you're the three poisons.
Scram!

345
00:30:45,800 --> 00:30:47,400
Fine!

346
00:30:58,000 --> 00:31:00,600
This place has become so dusty

347
00:31:01,400 --> 00:31:03,800
-A mouse!
-See if I don't skin it

348
00:31:05,200 --> 00:31:09,800
-When did it become so dirty?
-What happened to the temple?

349
00:31:11,800 --> 00:31:15,600
When the three deities had the powers
to bestow rank, fortune and longevity,

350
00:31:15,600 --> 00:31:18,200
the temple was packed with people

351
00:31:18,400 --> 00:31:21,200
Now that they've been relegated to
the mortal world,

352
00:31:21,200 --> 00:31:23,200
no one cares about us anymore

353
00:31:23,200 --> 00:31:28,800
Since they won't gain anything from
us, why should they give us offerings

354
00:31:37,000 --> 00:31:41,800
Each time we get into trouble,
no one will be able to find us here

355
00:31:43,400 --> 00:31:47,800
My father told me Three Star Temple
used to enjoy many worshippers

356
00:31:49,400 --> 00:31:51,400
It was packed with people

357
00:31:51,400 --> 00:31:53,400
How did it become like this?

358
00:31:53,400 --> 00:31:57,800
The deities probably lost their
powers, so no more worshippers

359
00:31:57,800 --> 00:32:00,400
It's just like how the poor
among us get ignored

360
00:32:00,400 --> 00:32:04,800
That's true. People are
a practical lot these days

361
00:32:04,800 --> 00:32:10,680
No one cares about how neglected
the three gold-plated deities are

362
00:32:10,680 --> 00:32:13,800
They're more pathetic than me

363
00:32:14,600 --> 00:32:16,400
Your stomach is rumbling again

364
00:32:16,480 --> 00:32:19,800
I can't help it.
I've not eaten for two days

365
00:32:19,800 --> 00:32:23,400
The rumbling could
have been worse, you know

366
00:32:24,400 --> 00:32:25,800
A tortoise!

367
00:32:28,800 --> 00:32:30,800
We've got food!

368
00:32:37,400 --> 00:32:40,800
Should we steam it or braise it?

369
00:32:41,200 --> 00:32:45,800
Fu, you've not eaten for two days.
You'll take it home

370
00:32:48,000 --> 00:32:52,800
Lu, your father makes you study
all day. Your brains must be tired

371
00:32:52,800 --> 00:32:57,400
You need some tonic.
You'll take the tortoise home

372
00:32:58,600 --> 00:33:01,200
It's said tortoise meat
is good for health

373
00:33:01,200 --> 00:33:05,800
Shouquan, you'll have it.
It's good for your body

374
00:33:05,800 --> 00:33:08,800
What's wrong?
Who's upset you this time?

375
00:33:09,200 --> 00:33:13,200
I've always been in poor health
and my classmates always tease me

376
00:33:13,200 --> 00:33:16,800
Besides my parents, no one cares
for me the way that you do

377
00:33:17,000 --> 00:33:20,400
Come on, you've been kind to me too

378
00:33:20,400 --> 00:33:24,400
Each time Master punishes me,
you'll keep me company

379
00:33:24,400 --> 00:33:27,800
You'll be on my side
each time I get into a fight

380
00:33:27,800 --> 00:33:30,000
And you always share
your food with me

381
00:33:30,000 --> 00:33:31,800
You're my best friends!

382
00:33:31,800 --> 00:33:35,800
Since we get along so well,
shall we become sworn brothers?

383
00:33:36,000 --> 00:33:39,800
Let the three deities
be our witnesses

384
00:33:40,400 --> 00:33:42,920
Good idea! But who shall be
the eldest brother?

385
00:33:43,200 --> 00:33:47,800
My father told me the three of us
were born right here at the same time

386
00:33:47,800 --> 00:33:51,800
In that case, let's do away
with seniority

387
00:33:53,600 --> 00:33:55,800
In the presence of the Three Stars,
I, Wei Delu...

388
00:33:55,800 --> 00:33:57,800
-Mei Shouquan
-Wu Fuqi

389
00:33:57,800 --> 00:34:00,400
Shall become sworn brothers.
As of now...

390
00:34:00,400 --> 00:34:03,400
-We'll fight together
-We'll share food

391
00:34:03,400 --> 00:34:05,200
We'll share toys

392
00:34:05,200 --> 00:34:09,400
We'll share weal and woe together!

393
00:34:11,800 --> 00:34:13,680
My good brothers

394
00:34:29,800 --> 00:34:31,400
20 years later

395
00:34:38,520 --> 00:34:40,400
Fu is back!

396
00:34:40,600 --> 00:34:42,200
Hide yourself, quick

397
00:34:44,400 --> 00:34:46,800
Mother, where is my double rod?

398
00:34:47,400 --> 00:34:52,000
I... I don't know. As if I'd know
where you keep your gadgets

399
00:34:53,880 --> 00:34:56,000
Where is my double rod?

400
00:34:56,800 --> 00:34:59,400
How would I know?

401
00:35:00,400 --> 00:35:03,200
I'm going to get changed.
Leave the room

402
00:35:03,200 --> 00:35:05,800
But your clothes are still clean

403
00:35:08,200 --> 00:35:11,800
Something stinks in here

404
00:35:12,200 --> 00:35:14,200
-Do you smell it?
-No

405
00:35:14,200 --> 00:35:15,200
No?

406
00:35:17,000 --> 00:35:18,000
Come out!

407
00:35:20,400 --> 00:35:23,200
Don't get the wrong idea.
I have a valid reason...

408
00:35:23,200 --> 00:35:24,800
What else is there to say?

409
00:35:24,800 --> 00:35:29,000
Our place has been infested with rats.
He's here to get rid of them

410
00:35:29,200 --> 00:35:33,400
-But you're never afraid of rats
-I am scared of big rats

411
00:35:33,600 --> 00:35:35,800
Do we have such big rats
in our house?

412
00:35:35,800 --> 00:35:36,800
You bet!

413
00:35:38,200 --> 00:35:40,400
I'm not going there!

414
00:35:41,200 --> 00:35:44,800
Why do you keep coming to my house
to borrow things?

415
00:35:44,800 --> 00:35:48,400
You even want to borrow my mother.
Are you tired of living?

416
00:35:55,400 --> 00:35:57,200
There it is!

417
00:35:58,800 --> 00:36:00,800
-That thing can kill
-Come here!

418
00:36:01,000 --> 00:36:04,200
That's quite enough
Are you out to kill him?

419
00:36:04,200 --> 00:36:06,400
Will that pain your heart?
You're such a disgrace

420
00:36:06,520 --> 00:36:09,400
I brought you up and
this is how you talk to me!

421
00:36:09,400 --> 00:36:12,200
Had I known, I'd have cooked you
in the pot your mother had put you in

422
00:36:12,200 --> 00:36:16,200
You demand my respect even as
you keep a lover behind my back?

423
00:36:16,400 --> 00:36:19,200
He's my good friend.
Don't you malign me

424
00:36:20,000 --> 00:36:22,400
I dare you to have me
drown in a cage!

425
00:36:22,400 --> 00:36:24,800
Go on, hit me!

426
00:36:26,000 --> 00:36:27,400
You'll be the death of me!

427
00:36:27,400 --> 00:36:32,400
Hold it right there!
How did I get a son like you?

428
00:36:32,400 --> 00:36:35,200
I got together with Datou
because of you!

429
00:36:35,400 --> 00:36:39,800
-Yes, your mother is pitiful...
-Don't interrupt our conversation

430
00:36:40,200 --> 00:36:45,800
Datou is thousands of times better
than those friends of yours

431
00:36:47,800 --> 00:36:52,400
Wu Fuqi, do you know
you've ruined my happiness?

432
00:36:52,400 --> 00:36:54,880
You should do some soul-searching

433
00:36:59,200 --> 00:37:01,400
I should do some soul-searching

434
00:37:04,400 --> 00:37:05,800
Come with me!

435
00:37:06,520 --> 00:37:09,200
Nothing happened between
your mother and me. Trust me

436
00:37:10,000 --> 00:37:13,800
Do you like my mother?
What did you say

437
00:37:14,200 --> 00:37:16,400
I like her

438
00:37:16,400 --> 00:37:21,200
My mother is my only kin.
If she's happy, I'll be happy

439
00:37:21,200 --> 00:37:23,400
If she's sad, I'll feel miserable

440
00:37:23,400 --> 00:37:27,800
If you let her down, I'll break your
neck and feed your head to the dogs!

441
00:37:28,400 --> 00:37:31,800
I've committed all the essays
to memory

442
00:37:32,000 --> 00:37:37,600
You're already 28.
But you've accomplished nothing

443
00:37:37,600 --> 00:37:43,400
Come on. I have memorized
all the classics and essays

444
00:37:43,800 --> 00:37:49,400
Your mother asked me to push you
to study hard before she passed away

445
00:37:49,480 --> 00:37:51,800
She hoped you'd earn an official rank

446
00:37:51,800 --> 00:37:56,400
Stop forcing me.
I'm not suited for officialdom

447
00:37:56,400 --> 00:37:59,800
You failed in your
last three attempts

448
00:37:59,800 --> 00:38:04,400
You must come back with
an official rank this time round

449
00:38:04,400 --> 00:38:07,800
On my first trip to the Capital,
I was robbed of all my money

450
00:38:07,800 --> 00:38:11,800
I've deposited money in the banks
in the counties you'll pass through

451
00:38:11,800 --> 00:38:15,800
Even if you get robbed,
you'll still have access to money

452
00:38:16,000 --> 00:38:19,600
I've got everything taken care of,
haven't I?

453
00:38:19,800 --> 00:38:25,600
Do you remember how I fell ill
on my second trip to the Capital?

454
00:38:25,600 --> 00:38:27,200
So I didn't make it
for the examination

455
00:38:27,800 --> 00:38:33,800
Lu, they are medicinal herbs
of all kinds

456
00:38:33,800 --> 00:38:39,800
You'll find herbs
for all seasons here

457
00:38:39,800 --> 00:38:43,200
Bring them with you on the journey.
It doesn't hurt to be prepared

458
00:38:43,400 --> 00:38:46,200
But there was the third time
when I failed

459
00:38:46,400 --> 00:38:49,800
I'm sorry to say
I missed the hour that time

460
00:38:49,800 --> 00:38:52,800
Father, please understand
I was beat from all the studying

461
00:38:52,800 --> 00:38:55,400
So I couldn't get up the next morning

462
00:38:56,400 --> 00:38:58,800
-Haoxue! Wujuan!
-Yes, Old Master?

463
00:38:58,800 --> 00:39:00,000
Greet Young Master

464
00:39:00,000 --> 00:39:01,200
-Haoxue
-Wujuan

465
00:39:01,200 --> 00:39:02,400
Greetings, Young Master

466
00:39:03,400 --> 00:39:04,800
Who are they?

467
00:39:04,800 --> 00:39:10,000
They'll be your page boys. They'll
ensure that you don't oversleep

468
00:39:10,400 --> 00:39:11,400
Haoxue

469
00:39:12,400 --> 00:39:13,400
Wujuan

470
00:39:21,480 --> 00:39:24,400
Father, you certainly
think of everything

471
00:39:24,400 --> 00:39:27,400
You think so too? Your trip to the
Capital will go smoothly this time

472
00:39:32,400 --> 00:39:35,800
Jiujin, the medicine is
for your uncle. Put it down

473
00:39:35,800 --> 00:39:37,400
Don't topple it

474
00:39:42,800 --> 00:39:44,800
Uncle, don't you dread
bitter stuff?

475
00:39:44,800 --> 00:39:49,000
I grew up on medicine. I've tasted
all kinds of bitter medicine

476
00:39:49,000 --> 00:39:52,400
-I'm used to it
-I'm sorry, Uncle

477
00:39:52,400 --> 00:39:56,000
-Why did you apologize?
-I caused you to sneeze

478
00:39:56,200 --> 00:40:00,400
Don't be silly. My sneezing
had nothing to do with you

479
00:40:00,400 --> 00:40:03,200
I sneezed because I was unwell

480
00:40:03,200 --> 00:40:08,200
Do you know that I suffer from
ailments of all kinds?

481
00:40:08,200 --> 00:40:12,400
-Is sneezing an ailment?
-Yes, it is

482
00:40:12,400 --> 00:40:16,400
You sneeze because of a sensitive
nose. Don't stay too near to me

483
00:40:16,400 --> 00:40:20,000
I'm down with a cold.
I don't wish to spread it to you

484
00:40:21,000 --> 00:40:22,800
Uncle, you're snacking again

485
00:40:22,800 --> 00:40:26,400
Granny will scold you again
if she finds out

486
00:40:27,400 --> 00:40:30,400
Jiujin is a good girl

487
00:40:30,400 --> 00:40:33,800
You won't tell Granny that
I've snacked secretly, right?

488
00:40:34,400 --> 00:40:36,200
It's a promise

489
00:40:37,400 --> 00:40:38,800
My precious!

490
00:40:40,400 --> 00:40:41,400
My precious

491
00:40:46,000 --> 00:40:49,800
Jiujin, what are you doing here?
Your mother may scold you

492
00:40:49,800 --> 00:40:51,800
I came to see Uncle

493
00:40:52,400 --> 00:40:56,400
Jiujin is a good girl.
You're my favourite girl

494
00:40:57,200 --> 00:40:59,400
Are you feeling better, my precious?

495
00:41:00,400 --> 00:41:05,200
Mother, I'm a grown-up.
Stop calling me precious

496
00:41:05,200 --> 00:41:08,800
Each time you call me that,
I'll shiver all over

497
00:41:16,200 --> 00:41:18,600
Cow's organs with five-spice powder

498
00:41:20,800 --> 00:41:22,200
Stop

499
00:41:25,400 --> 00:41:27,200
Excuse me

500
00:41:27,400 --> 00:41:29,200
Who are you?
Why should I give way?

501
00:41:39,000 --> 00:41:42,400
It was only a sneeze.
Did they have to panic?

502
00:41:43,800 --> 00:41:47,200
Let's move forward and see if
there is any good food

503
00:41:59,200 --> 00:42:01,800
Wei Delu, are you right up there?

504
00:42:01,800 --> 00:42:05,800
How could you laugh over
a natural disaster?

505
00:42:05,800 --> 00:42:07,800
Exactly! How could you!

506
00:42:07,800 --> 00:42:11,400
All that education has been wasted
on you. What a tragedy

507
00:42:12,400 --> 00:42:15,400
You've got me wrong, everyone

508
00:42:15,400 --> 00:42:17,800
I am right up there

509
00:42:17,800 --> 00:42:23,200
That the people are living in misery
is a cause of concern

510
00:42:23,200 --> 00:42:28,800
But the official court has written
"chou yin" (raise funds)...

511
00:42:28,800 --> 00:42:32,800
as "shou yin" (birthday gift)
of 200,000 taels

512
00:42:33,800 --> 00:42:35,400
Why is that so?

513
00:42:35,400 --> 00:42:38,800
Shi Yaoqian's mother's birthday
is probably round the corner

514
00:42:38,800 --> 00:42:45,800
This is when he'll cook up excuses
to rip the people of their money...

515
00:42:45,800 --> 00:42:48,200
to give to his mother
as a birthday gift

516
00:42:48,200 --> 00:42:51,800
That is how he exposes
his true colours

517
00:42:52,800 --> 00:42:58,400
Don't you agree that
he's revealed his true intentions?

518
00:42:59,200 --> 00:43:01,200
We can't allow this to happen

519
00:43:05,200 --> 00:43:12,800
Everyone, including me, is obliged to
raise funds to help the six provinces

520
00:43:13,000 --> 00:43:14,200
That's right

521
00:43:14,400 --> 00:43:18,800
But we shan't give a cent towards
Shi Yaoqian's mother's birthday gift

522
00:43:21,400 --> 00:43:23,200
What are you looking at?

523
00:43:25,200 --> 00:43:27,000
Lad, what are you selling?

524
00:43:27,000 --> 00:43:29,400
I'm asking you a question!
Did you have to run away?

525
00:43:34,400 --> 00:43:36,200
Crazy folks

526
00:43:44,200 --> 00:43:47,800
Who's so wicked as
to place a rope over here?

527
00:43:47,800 --> 00:43:50,000
Someone could trip and fall.
So inconsiderate

528
00:43:59,400 --> 00:44:01,600
What happened?

529
00:44:04,400 --> 00:44:06,400
The three vermins!

530
00:44:08,200 --> 00:44:10,400
-You again!
-I'm sorry

531
00:44:19,000 --> 00:44:20,800
Where has everyone gone?

532
00:44:20,800 --> 00:44:23,800
Fu, Lu, they've all left

533
00:44:25,200 --> 00:44:28,800
-They're all gone
-We still have an old man

534
00:44:29,400 --> 00:44:31,800
At least someone accepts us

535
00:44:31,800 --> 00:44:33,800
How do you do

536
00:44:34,200 --> 00:44:39,400
Someone gave me ten wen
to pass you this note

537
00:44:40,200 --> 00:44:41,400
Thank you

538
00:44:43,000 --> 00:44:45,200
"The year is coming to an end

539
00:44:45,200 --> 00:44:47,200
"The three vermins of Ping-an Town,
get lost!"

540
00:44:47,400 --> 00:44:48,600
The three vermins?

541
00:44:48,600 --> 00:44:53,800
-Darn it
-Are we that jinxed?

542
00:44:53,800 --> 00:44:55,400
Are we that terrifying?

543
00:44:55,600 --> 00:44:56,600
Subtitled by A Han


